T space who might benefit from regulatory consulting services.\n\n[\n  {\n    "name": "Elad Walach",\n    "company": "Aidoc",\n    "title": "CEO and Co-founder",\n    "rationale": "Aidoc has numerous FDA clearances (now at 17) for their AI imaging solutions and continues to pursue new clearances. As the company scales rapidly, they may benefit from specialized regulatory support to navigate the increasingly complex FDA environment, especially given recent FDA staffing changes in AI expertise that could impact future submissions.",\n    "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/elad-walach/",\n    "message": "Hi Elad, I noticed Aidoc\'s impressive growth with 17 FDA clearances for your clinical AI solutions. With the recent FDA staffing changes impacting AI review teams, I\'d like to connect about how NaviSure\'s specialized regulatory expertise can help maintain your clearance momentum and navigate the evolving regulatory landscape. Our team of former FDA reviewers has specific experience with AI imaging technologies and can help expedite future submissions. Would you be open to a brief conversation about how we\'ve helped similar companies overcome regulatory hurdles?"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "David Golan",\n    "company": "Viz.ai",\n    "title": "CTO and Co-founder",\n    "rationale": "Viz.ai has been actively seeking FDA clearances for their AI algorithms, with multiple submissions in recent years. Their platform includes more than 50 FDA-cleared AI algorithms, suggesting an active regulatory pipeline. Given the recent FDA layoffs that specifically impacted AI expertise at the agency, they may face challenges with upcoming submissions.",\n    "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/davidgolan/",\n    "message": "Hi David, I\'ve been following Viz.ai\'s impressive growth and your expanding portfolio of FDA-cleared AI algorithms. With the recent FDA staffing changes affecting the AI review team, I wanted to connect about how NaviSure\'s regulatory expertise could help maintain your clearance momentum. Our consultants, including former FDA reviewers, specialize in navigating complex AI/ML submissions and have specific experience with imaging algorithms similar to your stroke detection technology. Would you be open to discussing strategies to mitigate regulatory delays in the current environment?"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "Brandon Fornwalt",\n    "company": "Tempus AI",\n    "title": "Senior Vice President of Cardiology",\n    "rationale": "Tempus received FDA clearance for their ECG-AF algorithm in June 2024 and appears to be expanding their AI offerings. As a company juggling multiple therapeutic areas (oncology, cardiology) with active regulatory submissions, they may need specialized support, especially as they transition from being primarily a lab services company to a medical device manufacturer with AI products.",\n    "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandon-fornwalt/",\n    "message": "Hi Brandon, congratulations on Tempus\' recent FDA clearance for your ECG-AF algorithm. As you continue to expand your AI offerings beyond oncology into the cardiovascular space, I\'d like to connect about how NaviSure\'s regulatory expertise could support your FDA submission strategy. With recent changes at the FDA impacting AI reviews, our team of former FDA reviewers specifically experienced in cardiovascular AI applications could help streamline your future submissions. Would you be interested in a brief discussion about strategies that have worked for other AI developers in maintaining clearance momentum?"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "Emre Gulturk",\n    "company": "Paige AI",\n    "title": "Vice President of Regulatory Affairs and Quality",\n    "rationale": "Paige AI received historic FDA approval for their AI-based pathology product and continues to develop new applications. As a pioneer in the digital pathology space with a regulatory affairs leader who\'s navigated breakthrough designations, they may benefit from specialized consulting as they expand their product portfolio, especially given the rapidly evolving regulatory landscape for AI in pathology.",\n    "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/emregulturk/",\n    "message": "Hi Emre, I\'ve been following Paige\'s groundbreaking work']
