 FDA staffing changes have specifically impacted AI expertise at the agency, potentially affecting their regulatory timeline for newer products in their pipeline.",\n    "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/chrismansi/",\n    "message": "Hello Chris, I\'ve been impressed with Viz.ai\'s pioneering work in AI stroke detection and your expanding product portfolio. With the recent FDA staffing changes affecting AI expertise at the agency, I wanted to connect about NaviSure\'s specialized regulatory consulting services. Our team includes former FDA reviewers with specific AI SaMD experience who understand the current challenges in the regulatory review process. Would you be open to discussing how we\'ve helped companies navigate these challenges and secure timely clearances despite the agency\'s resource constraints?"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "Dan Vahdat",\n    "company": "Huma Therapeutics",\n    "title": "CEO & Founder",\n    "rationale": "Huma received FDA Class II clearance for their configurable SaMD disease management platform in June 2023, but they have additional AI modules and capabilities in development. As one of the first companies to use the FDA\'s eSTAR program, they\'re navigating complex regulatory pathways while the FDA experiences staffing challenges specifically in AI expertise.",\n    "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/danvahdat/",\n    "message": "Hello Dan, congratulations on Huma\'s FDA Class II clearance last year through the eSTAR program. As you continue developing advanced AI capabilities for your platform, I wanted to connect about NaviSure\'s specialized regulatory consulting services. With recent FDA staffing changes specifically affecting AI expertise, we can help navigate the increasingly complex regulatory landscape. Our team includes former FDA reviewers with direct experience in AI SaMD submissions using the eSTAR program. Would you be interested in discussing how we might support your continued regulatory success?"\n  